# YAML rules (scenarios and config)

## Scenarios

- `id`: kebab-case, globally unique within a suite
- Always include `tags` for filtering
- Prefer explicit `evaluators` and `expectations` over implicit behavior
- Document non-obvious fixtures with `#` comments

## Release policy (`agentguard.yaml`)

- `block_if`, `require_review_if`, `warn_if` — ordered severity
- Use measurable thresholds: `pass_rate < 0.95`, not vague rules

## Validation

- Scenarios must validate against Pydantic schema on load
- Fail fast with file path and field name in error messages
